cargo-schemata
Copyright (c) 2026 Takuto Tanaka

This project ports its mutation rules (exclusions, operators,
replacement values, and name formatting) and its rule for the time limit
of a mutant (`src/timeouts.rs`) from cargo-mutants.

The fixture crates under `tests/fixtures` are original. The files in
`tests/fixtures/expected` are the output of cargo-mutants 27.1.0 on them.

